# Core conflict surface of the three official repositories (git-only and source-build packages removed)
#
# flash-attn==2.8.3 is not listed here: TOPReward's QwenClient hard-codes
# attn_implementation="flash_attention_2" (missing means ImportError, never a silent fallback
# to sdpa; measured 2026-07-25, see docs/installation.md).
# It is not resolved by uv because only prebuilt wheels matching torch/cuda/python exist; install with:
#   uv pip install --python .venv/bin/python \
#     https://github.com/Dao-AILab/flash-attention/releases/download/v2.8.3/\
#     flash_attn-2.8.3+cu12torch2.8cxx11abiTRUE-cp311-cp311-linux_x86_64.whl
# (choose the TRUE/FALSE wheel variant from torch._C._GLIBCXX_USE_CXX11_ABI)
